msgstr "Klicken"

#. Translators: Activity log entry: Claude right-clicked
msgid "Right-clicking"
msgstr "Rechtsklick"

#. Translators: Activity log entry: Claude middle-clicked
msgid "Middle-clicking"
msgstr "Mittelklick"

#. Translators: Activity log entry: Claude moved the pointer. {x} and {y} are coordinates
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Moving the pointer to {x}, {y}"
msgstr "Mauszeiger nach {x}, {y} bewegen"

#. Translators: Activity log entry: Claude dragged with the mouse
msgid "Dragging"
msgstr "Ziehen"

#. Translators: Activity log entry for any other action. {action} is its name
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Performing action: {action}"
msgstr "Aktion ausführen: {action}"

#. Translators: Title of the computer use dialog
#. Translators: Title of a computer use message box
msgid "Claude Computer Use"
msgstr "Claude-Computersteuerung"

msgid "&What would you like Claude to do?"
msgstr "&Was soll Claude tun?"

msgid "Examples. Assistant: \"I'm stuck on this website, please tick the 'I agree' checkbox and press Continue.\" Screen-reader testing: \"Tab through this form and tell me whether every field is announced with a label.\""
msgstr "Beispiele. Assistent: „Ich komme auf dieser Website nicht weiter, bitte das Kontrollkästchen ‚Ich stimme zu‘ aktivieren und auf Weiter klicken.“ Screenreader-Test: „Mit Tab durch dieses Formular gehen und prüfen, ob jedes Feld mit einer Beschriftung angesagt wird.“"

#. Translators: Label for the computer use mode selector
msgid "&Mode"
msgstr "&Modus"

#. Translators: The computer use assistant mode
msgid "Assistant: do a task on my screen"
msgstr "Assistent: eine Aufgabe auf meinem Bildschirm erledigen"

#. Translators: The computer use screen-reader testing mode
msgid "Screen-reader testing: check accessibility with NVDA's speech"
msgstr "Screenreader-Test: Barrierefreiheit mit der Sprachausgabe von NVDA prüfen"

msgid "&Activity"
msgstr "&Aktivität"

#. Translators: Button that starts a computer use task
msgid "&Start"
msgstr "&Starten"

#. Translators: Button that stops a running computer use task
msgid "Sto&p"
msgstr "Sto&ppen"

#. Translators: Button that discards a finished computer use conversation
msgid "&New task"
msgstr "&Neue Aufgabe"

#. Translators: Button that closes the computer use dialog
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "S&chließen"

#. Translators: Announced when the computer use request is empty
msgid "Please type what you would like Claude to do."
msgstr "Bitte geben Sie ein, was Claude tun soll."

#. Translators: Activity log line when a computer use task starts
msgid "Starting."
msgstr "Wird gestartet."

#. Translators: Activity log line when a paused computer use task resumes
msgid "Resuming."
msgstr "Wird fortgesetzt."

#. Translators: Activity log line when a follow-up computer use request starts
msgid "Continuing."
msgstr "Es geht weiter."

#. Translators: Announced when a finished computer use conversation is discarded
msgid "New task. The previous conversation was discarded."
msgstr "Neue Aufgabe. Die vorherige Konversation wurde verworfen."

#. Translators: Activity log line when the user stops a computer use task
msgid "Stopping."
msgstr "Wird gestoppt."

#. Translators: Confirmation when closing the dialog while a computer use task runs
msgid "A task is still running. Stop it and close?"
msgstr "Eine Aufgabe läuft noch. Stoppen und schließen?"

#. Translators: Activity log prefix for an action Claude performed
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Aktion"

#. Translators: Activity log prefix for a status update
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. Translators: Activity log prefix for an error
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Fehler"

#. Translators: Button that resumes a paused computer use task
msgid "&Resume"
msgstr "&Fortsetzen"

#. Translators: Button that sends a follow-up once a computer use task finished
msgid "C&ontinue"
msgstr "W&eiter"

#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "ClauVDA (Anthropic Claude AI NVDA)"
msgstr "ClauVDA (Anthropic Claude AI NVDA)"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid ""
"Comprehensive Anthropic Claude AI capabilities integrated into NVDA.\n"
"Supports Claude Haiku 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Opus 5.5, and Fable 5.1 for chat, image description, and more."
msgstr ""
"Umfassende Funktionen von Anthropic Claude AI, integriert in NVDA.\n"
"Unterstützt Claude Haiku 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Opus 5.5 und Fable 5.1 für Chat, Bildbeschreibung und mehr."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "Updated to the latest Claude models with Haiku 5.5 as the default. Adds computer use, PDF summaries and OCR, web search, and reasoning effort settings."
msgstr "Auf die neuesten Claude-Modelle aktualisiert, mit Haiku 5.5 als Standard. Neu sind Computersteuerung, PDF-Zusammenfassungen und OCR, Websuche sowie Einstellungen für den Denkaufwand."
